# --- Zig build output and caches ----------------------------------------------
# Everything here is regenerated by `zig build`.
zig-out/
.zig-cache/
# Cache directory name used by Zig versions before 0.13.
zig-cache/
# Packages downloaded by `zig fetch` (dependencies are declared in build.zig.zon).
zig-pkg/

# Object files and debug symbols from building outside `zig build`
# (e.g. `zig build-exe src/main.zig` drops these in the project root).
*.o
*.obj
*.exe
*.pdb
*.ilk

# Note: vendor/raylib/lib/libraylib.a is intentionally committed (the bundled
# raylib for Windows), so `*.a` is NOT ignored here.

# --- App runtime files -----------------------------------------------------------
# Per-user settings, written next to the executable.
diskviz.ini

# Temporary folders created by the unit tests (normally removed automatically,
# but left behind if a test run is interrupted).
ztmp_*/

# --- Editors -------------------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# --- OS clutter ----------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
